# (AI-assisted) linear memory with the tightest level pairs loaded (c3l v13 vista tier), and the
# teleport loads that stop the game. Read the [ctr] textures lines (linear free) between "pair" and
# "pair-end", the [ctr] loaded lines and [load] lines. ~6 min in the emulator; config sound = off
# (or the instance muted) unless load timing with sound matters.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
300 continue lavatube-end
301 wait *target* target-continue
302 wait *target* target-stance
303 log pair lavatube+citadel
900 shot
1200 log pair-end lavatube+citadel
1201 continue finalboss-start
1202 wait *target* target-continue
1203 wait *target* target-stance
1204 log pair finalboss+citadel
1800 shot
2100 log pair-end finalboss+citadel
2101 continue robocave-start
2102 wait *target* target-continue
2103 wait *target* target-stance
2104 log pair maincave+robocave
3000 log pair-end maincave+robocave
3001 continue darkcave-start
3002 wait *target* target-continue
3003 wait *target* target-stance
3004 log pair maincave+darkcave
3900 log pair-end maincave+darkcave
3901 continue sunkenb-start
3902 wait *target* target-continue
3903 wait *target* target-stance
3904 log pair sunken+sunkenb
4800 log pair-end sunken+sunkenb
4801 continue ogre-end
4802 wait *target* target-continue
4803 wait *target* target-stance
4804 log pair village3+ogre
5400 shot
5700 log pair-end village3+ogre
5701 continue snow-fort
5702 wait *target* target-continue
5703 wait *target* target-stance
5704 log pair snow+village3
6300 shot
6600 log pair-end snow+village3
6601 exit
